{
  "description": "A breadcrumb left by a crashed boot (no prior good patch): the next init tombstones the patch BootCrash, deletes its artifact, boots base, and queues __patch_install_failure__. The breadcrumb carries a boot-attempt tally at the retire threshold (2): below it the updater treats a boot that did not finish as ambiguous and retries it (see boot/crash_below_threshold_retries_the_patch).",
  "files": {
    "storage/state.json": {
